["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Age of Body Futurism | Ruby Justice Thelot paracontent body futurism quantified self GLP-1 peptides\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-a16z-肽和-glp-1-的流行-其实不是硅谷发明的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">42:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>肽和 GLP-1 的流行，其实不是硅谷发明的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">肽文化先在德州和健美圈流行，才被硅谷专业化和加速；真正值得警惕的是「关于内容的内容」比内容本身还多，让人误判什么真的在发生。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费文化</span><span class=\"tag\">健康科技</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Tobi Lütke: AI Agents, Better Decisions, and the Future of Work skeuomorphism slop grenades Goodhart&#x27;s law refounding event\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-knowledge-ai-不能承担责任-所以-ceo-不会被替换/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/364b2175d897a9eb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">The Knowledge Project</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>AI 不能承担责任，所以 CEO 不会被替换</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tobi Lütke 说机器能帮你把判断的环境搭好，但机器不能坐牢、不能被追责。Shopify 一半的 PR 已由聊天频道里的 AI 同事 River 发起，而人类保留的只剩品味与判断。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">组织设计</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Let’s Kill Sh*t: Axios CEO on simplifying your work-life in the AI era post-processable velocity messy middle cognitive fatigue force multiplier table stakes\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-masterscale-ai-短期是复杂制造机-不是效率工具/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/df59dc4c1e43fb63-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">32:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Masters of Scale</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>AI 短期是复杂制造机，不是效率工具</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 让每个人都能写、能做研究，结果是更多邮件、更多演示、更多决定。Jim VandeHei 说，短期它制造复杂，只有主动删减才能拿回时间。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 效率</span><span class=\"tag\">组织管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"How to build a secure attachment with yourself: The connection between self-worth and parenting with Dr. Marisa G. Franco secureish self-verification theory memory reconsolidation covert avoidance mere exposure effect reflective functioning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-secureattach-越想变安全-越不安全-安全型是能承认自己不安全/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">48:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>越想变安全，越不安全：安全型是能承认自己不安全</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">安全型不是没有焦虑、回避和嫉妒，而是能当这些情绪的安全容器。把不安全的部分推开，等于在自己身上重演当年让你不安全的批评与忽视。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">依恋理论</span><span class=\"tag\">自我价值</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Doves Type Doves Type apologia photo-engraving\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-ninepi-他把整套铅字倒进泰晤士河-只为没人能用它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e11e283634cdaaa8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"9\"><span class=\"dur\">37:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">99% Invisible</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>他把整套铅字倒进泰晤士河，只为没人能用它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Thomas Cobden-Sanderson 用 173 个夜晚把 2600 磅 Doves Type 倒进泰晤士河，因为铅字是实物，倒掉就是独占。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">字体设计</span><span class=\"tag\">出版史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Special Episode: Dr. Alanna Skuse &amp; The Surgeon, The Midwife, The Quack humors apothecary quack mountebank uroscopy non-naturals\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-tpwky-文艺复兴的医生分四等-最会治病的却被叫庸医/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>文艺复兴的医生分四等，最会治病的却被叫庸医</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">骨接师每周赶集接骨，比一年做几例的正式外科医生更熟练，却被医生骂成庸医——头衔和本事从来不是一回事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医学史</span><span class=\"tag\">文艺复兴</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"289: Signs Your Teen is Heading Towards an Eating Disorder | Dr. Kelly Bhatnagar Maudsley family-based treatment (FBT) body neutrality disordered eating\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-asklisa-孩子开始吃得健康-可能是进食障碍的起点/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e802a0f21fabf964-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">34:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>孩子开始吃得健康，可能是进食障碍的起点</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">进食障碍靠保密存活，所以家长看到苗头就该说出口。孩子不会因此更糟，反而可能松一口气——因为终于有人替她做决定了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年心理</span><span class=\"tag\">进食障碍</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Don’t Let School Be the End of Play unstructured play downtime self-directed play\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-unruffled-上学不是玩的终点-自由玩耍反而更珍贵/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">24:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>上学不是玩的终点，自由玩耍反而更珍贵</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">孩子进入全日制学校后，独立、无结构的玩耍不是被取代，而是变得更稀缺、更重要——它是孩子消化学校刺激、发展创造力的核心途径。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿</span><span class=\"tag\">玩耍</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Connecting homes to the internet using cable TV coax cable signal-to-noise ratio royalty-free\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-witness-他放弃专利费-让美国家庭用有线电视上网/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ad7b76f4c635f2c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">10:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Witness History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>他放弃专利费，让美国家庭用有线电视上网</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1991年，一个伊朗裔工程师用已有的同轴电缆让数据双向进出家庭，并把技术免版税捐给电信业成为全球标准——他本可以靠它赚几十亿。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">互联网史</span><span class=\"tag\">有线电视</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Elon Musk &amp; Gwynne Shotwell on AI Risks and Peer Review, Starship, Terafab, SpaceX/Tesla Merger test harness eval player coach direct-to-cell\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-allin-ai-巨头互相测试模型-比自建监管机构更可行/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f4dc045ca7baf461-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>AI 巨头互相测试模型，比自建监管机构更可行</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Elon 说 AI 危险是真的，但解法不是联合国式的监管机构，而是让竞争对手互相跑测试 harness——因为没人能给自己判卷，中国也只会接受这种不丢面子的方案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">SpaceX</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"ModelTalk: Pacing the Frontier pacing the frontier RSI open weights hill climb\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-chinatalk-ai-安全联盟突然成型-但没人知道怎么量-前沿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d73b1da16568d412-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>AI 安全联盟突然成型，但没人知道怎么量「前沿」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Hugging Face 事件让左翼和 AI 安全派第一次合流，可「pacing the frontier」这个词本身就没法测量——没有立法，第三方评估只是自愿的善意。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">监管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"182.全球宏观和资本市场2026三季度复盘与展望：多重囚徒困境 CAPEX ROA carry trade hyperscaler 二阶导\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-cna29e88-美债利率逼近5-ai叙事为何还不破/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c7765283e8bf256a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"起\"><span class=\"dur\">1:39:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">起朱楼宴宾客</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>美债利率逼近5%，AI叙事为何还不破</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国资金越来越贵，AI却还在通胀，其他行业都在通缩。这个矛盾要么靠AI真突破把利率打下来，要么等它被证伪——但没人敢先慢下来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宏观</span><span class=\"tag\">美债</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The AI Slowdown Debate | Diet TBPN pacing the frontier PBC Sherman Antitrust Act Section 230 METER\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-tbpn-ai-减速之争-dario-的三步计划-sam-和-elon-都点了头/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c331d210a13011ec-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">25:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TBPN</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>AI 减速之争：Dario 的三步计划，Sam 和 Elon 都点了头</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dario 周六早上发文要求「pace the frontier」，Sam 和 Elon 当天先后背书；但真正的新事实只有一个——OpenAI 和 Anthropic 将嵌入第三方评估者，而这一步可能需要先豁免反垄断法。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 监管</span><span class=\"tag\">pacing the frontier</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jensen Huang: The Doomer Hoax, Superintelligence Is Here, and The Future of AI (ft. President Trump) RSI LoRA NeoCloud land power shell hyperscaler\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-allin-黄仁勋-ai-末日论是编出来的-超级智能已经到了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/08e1dfbffee89d60-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">46:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋：AI 末日论是编出来的，超级智能已经到了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黄仁勋把前沿实验室的灭绝预测称为「编出来的」不负责任言论，并说超级智能不是未来时——在自动驾驶、蛋白质合成这些窄领域，它已经比人做得更好。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Ep. 030 - Long Live the Short King: Why 4-HI HBM Wins (Memory) | Myron Xie, Jordan Nanos HBM 4-HI / 8-HI / 12-HI KV cache MXFP4 scale-up domain\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-semianalysiswe-英伟达旗舰-gpu-内存首次倒退-4-hi-hbm-为什么赢/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d3f66fbf6cfa27e9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">38:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">SemiAnalysis Weekly</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>英伟达旗舰 GPU 内存首次倒退：4-HI HBM 为什么赢</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Rubin Ultra 的 HBM 从承诺的 1TB 砍到 192GB，比现在出货的 288GB 还少。这不是技术退步，是 DRAM 短缺下的产能配给：4-HI 堆叠良率更高，能榨出两倍以上的 HBM cube。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">HBM</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Humanity’s Last Invention — Richard Socher of Recursive Eureka Machine metacognition reward hack harness hypercube\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-latentspace-ai-能走出超立方体-但走不出已知概念/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3c02235bfde016a9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:32:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>AI 能走出超立方体，但走不出已知概念</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Socher 把智能拆成预测、行动、目标三个主成分，认为当前 AI 只能在已知概念的超立方体内工作，还无法定义全新概念或自造目标。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 自动研究</span><span class=\"tag\">对齐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"&quot;In the 1640s, people searched for the devil’s followers”: hunting witches in the Civil War Witchfinder General witch mark ducking familiar assize court\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-historyextra-内战撕裂英国时-人们开始寻找魔鬼的追随者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/59a7b48bd6e3c771-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Extra</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>内战撕裂英国时，人们开始寻找魔鬼的追随者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1640年代的猎巫不是中世纪的余烬，而是内战、经济崩溃与宗教恐惧共同点燃的：被指控者多为贫穷女性，而猎巫人靠收费服务把恐惧做成了生意。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">猎巫</span><span class=\"tag\">英国内战</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Why Conversations Go Wrong machine gun questions a vision of sanity a rhetoric of good intentions lies of omission difficult conversations\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-hiddenbrain-对话出问题-多半不是恶意-是节奏没对上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda02344d4b647e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">1:38:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Brain</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>对话出问题，多半不是恶意，是节奏没对上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">同一段沉默，在一方是礼貌等待，在另一方是冷场；打断是两个人共同完成的，一个人开始说，另一个人停下来。误解难解，是因为我们根本没有谈论这一层的语言。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">沟通</span><span class=\"tag\">跨文化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"鹿客陈彬：把一家 12 年的硬件公司，重写成 AI 原生组织 HARO FDE Agent Builder AI Buff IPD SP / BP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-cn18b4d2-ai-原生组织不是人人用-ai-是假设组织不存在重写一遍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8ed1bc4bf674ad3a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">AI炼金术</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>AI 原生组织不是人人用 AI，是假设组织不存在重写一遍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">鹿客把 HR 和 IT 合并成 HARO，让技术出身的人管人和 AI；圈长拿奖金包分配权，招人要先证明 AI 干不了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 原生组织</span><span class=\"tag\">组织变革</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Philippe Pinel mental alienation moral treatment nosography phrenology Thermidorian Reaction\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-stuffmissed-他解开了精神病人的锁链-却造出了心理锁链/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>他解开了精神病人的锁链，却造出了心理锁链</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Pinel 让 Bicêtre 的死亡率一年内从 50% 降到 13% 以下，靠的主要是清洁；但他否认脑器质性病因，被福柯指为用心理锁链替换了铁锁链。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医学史</span><span class=\"tag\">精神病学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Charged Black Holes and Charged Particle Production - Mykhaylo Usatyuk near extremal black hole Schwarzian modes superradiance Schwinger pair production worldline instanton\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-instituteforad-带电黑洞发射带电粒子-量子引力修正几乎不起作用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ff68ea9159caf005-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">InstituteForAdvancedStudy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>带电黑洞发射带电粒子，量子引力修正几乎不起作用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">近极端黑洞的量子修正会大幅改写光子与引力子的霍金谱，但换成带电粒子，修正几乎消失——因为粒子大多在远离视界的喉部产生，感受不到视界附近的度规涨落。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子引力</span><span class=\"tag\">黑洞</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Incentives Are for Losers (with Adam Mastroianni) Rube Goldberg machine big fish obedience to the unenforceable blackpilled\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-econtalk-遵守激励是失败者行为-你该自己判断对错/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>遵守激励是失败者行为：你该自己判断对错</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">经济学家说改好激励就能改好世界，Mastroianni 说这漏了一半：就算你有理由做坏事，你也不该做。把价值判断外包给激励结构，是放弃了做人的核心任务。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">激励机制</span><span class=\"tag\">学术生态</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Greg Brockman on Why OpenAI Says We’re Entering the AGI Era jagged frontier pacing the frontier defense factory trusted access program Lean\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-a16z-openai-宣布进入-agi-时代-但算力不够分给所有人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 宣布进入 AGI 时代，但算力不够分给所有人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Greg Brockman 说 Astra 能连续跑 24 小时完成任务，可以叫 AGI；真正的瓶颈不是模型能力，而是算力和安全对齐，模型再强也未必能便宜地送到每个人手里。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Six Tokens To Own This Cycle | Yan Liberman cashmaxing reflexive assets regulatory ARB emerging managers\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-empire-ai-抢走人才后-加密的机会只剩六种代币/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ee6bb56a5beaa83-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">59:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Empire（Blockworks）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>AI 抢走人才后，加密的机会只剩六种代币</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Delphi 的 Yan Liberman 说，加密风投一年只出手一笔，因为 AI 把聪明人全吸走了；真正能赚钱的只剩少数有真实收入、且不依赖加密行情的代币。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">加密投资</span><span class=\"tag\">代币组合</span>\n</div></div></a>"]